=== A1: the six pine tests on origin/main, and what replaced them ===

--- before: crates/pine/tests/workspace_deps.rs on origin/main ---
  feeds_depend_on_the_domain_crates_only
  the_domain_crates_never_depend_upwards
  every_crate_is_covered_by_a_dependency_rule
  claude_md_lists_every_crate
  third_party_versions_are_stated_only_in_the_root_manifest
  every_crate_inherits_the_workspace_lints

--- after: the graph guard's tests in quantick-guards ---
  graph::tests::a_crate_absent_from_the_architecture_list_is_a_finding
  graph::tests::a_crate_that_does_not_inherit_the_lints_is_a_finding
  graph::tests::a_crate_with_no_rule_is_reported_rather_than_left_unguarded
  graph::tests::a_feed_may_not_reach_past_the_domain_or_another_feed
  graph::tests::a_multi_line_inline_table_cannot_hide_its_pin
  graph::tests::a_reverse_edge_is_a_finding_that_names_the_rule
  graph::tests::a_third_party_version_outside_the_root_manifest_is_a_finding
  graph::tests::a_workspace_that_obeys_every_rule_is_clean
  graph::tests::the_edge_count_is_the_sum_of_what_every_crate_may_reach
  graph::tests::the_hook_reads_manifests_and_the_architecture_list_and_nothing_else
  graph::tests::this_workspace_obeys_the_graph
  the_crate_graph_runs_one_way   (tests/guards.rs, over the real workspace)

--- the mapping, rule by rule ---
  feeds_depend_on_the_domain_crates_only        -> a_feed_may_not_reach_past_the_domain_or_another_feed
  the_domain_crates_never_depend_upwards        -> a_reverse_edge_is_a_finding_that_names_the_rule
  every_crate_is_covered_by_a_dependency_rule   -> a_crate_with_no_rule_is_reported_rather_than_left_unguarded
  claude_md_lists_every_crate                   -> a_crate_absent_from_the_architecture_list_is_a_finding
  third_party_versions_are_stated_only_in_...   -> a_third_party_version_outside_the_root_manifest_is_a_finding
                                                   + a_multi_line_inline_table_cannot_hide_its_pin
  every_crate_inherits_the_workspace_lints      -> a_crate_that_does_not_inherit_the_lints_is_a_finding

  All six asserted against the real workspace only. Each now has a fixture
  test that proves the rule fires, plus this_workspace_obeys_the_graph and
  the CI-level the_crate_graph_runs_one_way, which assert what the six did.

