  headless::tests::a_clock_read_in_a_headless_crate_is_a_finding_that_names_the_rule
  headless::tests::a_clock_read_inside_a_test_module_is_not_a_hit
  headless::tests::a_forbidden_identifier_inside_a_comment_is_not_a_hit
  headless::tests::a_missing_allowlist_still_reports_the_hits
  headless::tests::a_shortened_spelling_is_the_same_hit
  headless::tests::a_signed_entry_silences_exactly_its_own_hit
  headless::tests::a_slash_pair_inside_a_string_does_not_hide_the_rest_of_the_line
  headless::tests::a_word_that_merely_contains_a_needle_is_not_a_hit
  headless::tests::an_entry_that_no_longer_matches_anything_is_itself_a_finding
  headless::tests::an_entry_with_no_reason_is_refused
  headless::tests::every_forbidden_identifier_is_found
  headless::tests::the_hook_does_not_report_a_stale_entry_for_another_file
  headless::tests::the_hook_reads_headless_sources_and_nothing_else
  headless::tests::the_line_number_survives_a_test_module_in_the_middle
  headless::tests::the_scanned_crates_are_the_ones_the_rule_names
  headless::tests::this_workspace_is_headless
  the_crates_below_app_stay_headless   (tests/guards.rs, over the real workspace)
